; The image capture flow drives a whole MVU application - selection, the
; processing command, the sharpness branch and the upload - through the test
; renderer, so it belongs beside the other application-flow tests rather than
; under test/unit/nopal_image. It reaches nopal_element, nopal_http and
; nopal_test, all of which sit above nopal_image; keeping it in that package's
; own test directory would have pointed the lowest package in the chain at three
; packages above it.

(test
 (name test_image_processing_flow)
 (modules test_image_processing_flow)
 (libraries
  nopal_image
  nopal_mvu
  nopal_element
  nopal_http
  nopal_test
  test_util
  alcotest))
